# AfriPay Environment Variables

Copy this file to `.env` in the `backend/` directory and fill in values for local development.

```env
# Server
PORT=3001
NODE_ENV=development

# Database (TypeORM dependency present; persistence not yet wired in app module)
DATABASE_URL=

# Redis (used by exchange-rate caching)
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379

# Stellar / Soroban (testnet by default — not yet wired to backend routes)
STELLAR_NETWORK=testnet
STELLAR_HORIZON_URL=https://horizon-testnet.stellar.org
STELLAR_RPC_URL=https://soroban-testnet.stellar.org

# Exchange rates (Open Exchange Rates)
OPEN_EXCHANGE_RATES_APP_ID=

# MTN Mobile Money (sandbox by default)
MTN_MOMO_BASE_URL=https://sandbox.momodeveloper.mtn.com
MTN_MOMO_TARGET_ENVIRONMENT=sandbox
MTN_MOMO_API_KEY=
MTN_MOMO_COLLECTION_API_USER=
MTN_MOMO_COLLECTION_API_SECRET=
MTN_MOMO_DISBURSEMENT_API_USER=
MTN_MOMO_DISBURSEMENT_API_SECRET=
MTN_MOMO_CALLBACK_URL=
MTN_MOMO_WEBHOOK_TOKEN=

# Africa's Talking USSD (when wired to production callback URL)
AFRICASTALKING_USERNAME=
AFRICASTALKING_API_KEY=
```

Never commit real API keys, secrets, or wallet private keys.
